  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "kind": "message",
   "text": "Good, there are 187 mismatches, confirming that using fulfillment store matters. Every order has a fulfillment record. Now let's compute gross sales by fulfilling store for Q2 2026 (2026-04-01 to 2026-06-30), based on sale date.",
   "name": ""
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "kind": "tool_call",
   "text": "{\"sql\": \"\\nSELECT f.shipped_from AS store, sm.name, ROUND(SUM(p.qty*p.unit_price),2) AS gross_sales, COUNT(*) AS line_count\\nFROM pos_sales p\\nJOIN fulfillment f ON p.order_id = f.order_id\\nJOIN store_map sm ON sm.store = f.shipped_from\\nWHERE p.sold_on >= '2026-04-01' AND p.sold_on <= '2026-06-30'\\nGROUP BY f.shipped_from, sm.name\\nORDER BY store\\n\"}",
   "name": "run_sql"
  },
  {
   "role": "tool",
   "kind": "tool_result",
   "text": "{\"columns\": [\"store\", \"name\", \"gross_sales\", \"line_count\"], \"rows\": [[\"S1\", \"Harbor\", 30141.49, 239], [\"S2\", \"Midtown\", 31070.58, 237], [\"S3\", \"Eastgate\", 28051.85, 211], [\"S4\", \"Northside\", 30963.64, 235]], \"truncated\": false, \"error\": null}",
   "name": "run_sql"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "kind": "tool_call",
   "text": "{\"sql\": \"\\nSELECT ROUND(SUM(p.qty*p.unit_price),2) AS total_gross\\nFROM pos_sales p\\nWHERE p.sold_on >= '2026-04-01' AND p.sold_on <= '2026-06-30'\\n\"}",
   "name": "run_sql"
  },
  {
   "role": "tool",
   "kind": "tool_result",
   "text": "{\"columns\": [\"total_gross\"], \"rows\": [[120227.56]], \"truncated\": false, \"error\": null}",
   "name": "run_sql"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "kind": "message",
   "text": "Sum of the four store totals (30141.49+31070.58+28051.85+30963.64 = 120,227.56) matches the total gross sales for Q2, confirming the fulfillment-store reattribution covers every line item correctly.\n\nANSWER: For Q2 2026 (2026-04-01 through 2026-06-30, sale date basis), gross sales attributed to the store that actually fulfilled each order were Midtown (S2) highest at $31,070.58, followed by Northside (S4) at $30,963.64, Harbor (S1) at $30,141.49, and Eastgate (S3) lowest at $28,051.85, totaling $120,227.56 across all stores. Note this differs from a simple store-of-sale view since 187 order lines were fulfilled by a different store than the one recorded on the sale, per the pos_sales vs fulfillment.shipped_from comparison.\nNUMBERS: {\"gross_sales_q2_2026_by_fulfilling_store\": {\"S1_Harbor\": 30141.49, \"S2_Midtown\": 31070.58, \"S3_Eastgate\": 28051.85, \"S4_Northside\": 30963.64, \"total\": 120227.56}, \"reattributed_lines_count\": 187}\nEVIDENCE: pos_sales, fulfillment, store_map\nACTIONS: none",
